{"id":"povod","lemma":"повод","pos":"noun","rank":1414,"glosses":["rein, bridle, bridle-rein"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/ce/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%BE%D0%B4.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%BE%D0%B4.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"повода","plural":"поводья"},"examples":[{"text":"Казалось, никто не имел повода для убийства.","en":"Nobody seemed to have a motive for the murder.","words":[{"g":"to seem","l":"казаться"},{"g":"nobody, no one"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to have, to possess","l":"иметь"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"murder, homicide","l":"убийство"}]},{"text":"Им не нужен повод.","en":"They don't need a reason.","words":[{"g":"(to) them","l":"он"},{"g":"not"},null,null]},{"text":"Есть повод отпраздновать.","en":"There's reason to celebrate.","words":[{"g":"there is / to eat"},null,{"g":"to celebrate"}]},{"text":"У нас нет повода для спешки.","en":"There is no need for us to hurry.","words":[{"g":"at / by"},{"g":"us","l":"мы"},{"g":"no / there isn't"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"hurry, haste","l":"спешка"}]},{"text":"Нет абсолютно никакого повода для беспокойства.","en":"There's absolutely no cause for concern.","words":[{"g":"no / there isn't"},{"g":"absolutely"},null,null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"anxiety","l":"беспокойство"}]}]}